<title>UK: Benpres Holdings sets $150 mln Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Benpres Holdings sets $150 mln Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BENPRES HOLDINGS CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    19.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.514    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    99.514    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/PH/HK/SI/JP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
